  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Felyne Insurance</strong> <em>(Daily Skill)</em></p><p>The first time you or an ally drops to 0 hit points on the hunt, they instead drop to 1 hit point.</p><p><em>Active Effect sets MidiQOL min HP to 1 for the bearer. For an ally, apply a copy of this feature (or AE) to them; remove after the first trigger.</em></p><p><em>Artisan Cooking Daily Skill. Gained when a meal succeeds by 4+ (roll once) or by 8+ (roll twice). Apply to hunters who ate the meal; duration is typically until the end of the hunt or 24 hours (DM&apos;s call), unless noted otherwise.</em></p>",
      "chat": "<p><strong>Felyne Insurance</strong></p><p>First drop to 0 HP on the hunt → 1 HP instead.</p>"
    },
